<refentry id="SQL-RESET">
 <refmeta>
  <refentrytitle id="SQL-RESET-TITLE">RESET</refentrytitle>
  <refmiscinfo>SQL - 语言语句</refmiscinfo>
 </refmeta>
 <refnamediv>
  <refname>RESET</refname>
  <refpurpose>恢复运行时参数为默认值</refpurpose>
 </refnamediv>
 <refsynopsisdiv>
  <synopsis>
RESET <replaceable class="PARAMETER">variable</replaceable>
  </synopsis>

  <refsect2 id="R2-SQL-RESET-1">
   <title>输入</title>
   <para>		
    <variablelist>
     <varlistentry>
      <term><replaceable class="PARAMETER">variable</replaceable></term>
      <listitem>
       <para>
	运行时参数的名称。列表请参阅<xref
	linkend="sql-set" endterm="sql-set-title">。
       </para>
      </listitem>
     </varlistentry>
    </variablelist>
   </para>
  </refsect2>

 </refsynopsisdiv>
  
 <refsect1>
  <title>描述</title>
  <para>
   <command>RESET</command>将运行时参数恢复为其默认值。细节请参阅<xref linkend="sql-set" endterm="sql-set-title">。<command>RESET</command>是下面语句的替代形式

   <synopsis>
SET <replaceable class="parameter">variable</replaceable> TO DEFAULT
   </synopsis>
  </para>
 </refsect1>

 <refsect1>
  <title>诊断</title>
  <para>
   请参阅<xref linkend="sql-set"
   endterm="sql-set-title">命令一节。
  </para>
 </refsect1>

 <refsect1>
  <title>示例</title>
  <para>
   把 DateStyle 设为默认值：

<screen>
RESET DateStyle;
</screen>
  </para>

  <para>
   把 Geqo 设为默认值：

<screen>   
RESET GEQO;
</screen>
  </para>
 </refsect1>

 <refsect1>
  <title>兼容性</title>

  <para>
   <command>RESET</command>是<productname>Postgres</productname>扩展。
  </para>
 </refsect1>
</refentry>

